["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Shadows, war, and finding Moomin joy GARM The Groke Moomin Characters Oy Limited\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-throughline-姆明的第一本书只卖了219本-真正让它爆红的是第三本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1646x1646+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F26%2Fcc%2F0e9f396b43a2b6ae03ba86b3f606%2Fd3ab8c80-c449-4882-8644-470d9f6df324.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>姆明的第一本书只卖了219本，真正让它爆红的是第三本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">姆明的前两本书是她在二战轰炸声中写下的末日寓言，几乎无人问津；真正让她成名的第三本不再直接写战争，却仍留了一个阴森角色提醒读者恐惧从未真正消失。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芬兰历史</span><span class=\"tag\">二战</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why SoftBank paid me 17 yen to skip the air conditioning demand response virtual power plant base load peaker plant stranded generation CapEx / OpEx\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-complexsys-ai数据中心全天候运转-芯片折旧比电费贵5到10倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5cd9c21e737bb124-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">26:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI数据中心全天候运转：芯片折旧比电费贵5到10倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI推理的芯片折旧是电费的五到十倍，比特币挖矿只有一点五到三倍，这个比例差决定了AI数据中心会全天候运行而不是像矿机那样为省电随时停机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">电力市场</span><span class=\"tag\">虚拟电厂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Easter Island Moai Manavai Rano Raraku Pukao Tangata Manu Mata&#x27;a\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-ancients-复活节岛不是生态自杀-杀死人口的是欧洲瘟疫-不是滥伐森林/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a572716032db7f6f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>复活节岛不是生态自杀：杀死人口的是欧洲瘟疫，不是滥伐森林</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">欧洲人在库克船长抵达前四年已登岛，带来岛民毫无免疫力的旧大陆疾病，真正摧毁人口的是这场瘟疫，而不是岛民自己造成的森林滥伐。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古学</span><span class=\"tag\">太平洋史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Medieval Ghost Stories Purgatory Harlequin haunt Byland Abbey ghost stories\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-historyhit-新教没有赶走中世纪的鬼-只是换成了更凶的恶魔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06ac7e08f7ad2c21-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">27:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>新教没有赶走中世纪的鬼，只是换成了更凶的恶魔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新教徒说鬼魂是天主教迷信，但他们解释灵异的办法不是取消它，而是把讨债的鬼换成了更危险的恶魔——詹姆斯六世1597年写的《恶魔学》就是证据。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">鬼故事</span><span class=\"tag\">中世纪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"718. The Suez Crisis: Britain&#x27;s Shattered Empire (Part 2) special relationship Eisenhower Doctrine lie doggo\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-restishistory-苏伊士战场英法完胜埃及-真正让他们撤军的是美国一通电话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e06c9ce2b8657d9d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>苏伊士战场英法完胜埃及，真正让他们撤军的是美国一通电话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英法两天内摧毁埃及空军，地面战线节节推进，却因英镑在美国施压下濒临崩盘，被迫仓促下令停火撤军。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">苏伊士危机</span><span class=\"tag\">英美关系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"408. JFK: Nixon, McCarthy, &amp; The Dark Side of Camelot (Part 2) Addison&#x27;s disease lobotomy Profiles in Courage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-empirehist-肯尼迪意外输掉副总统候选提名-反而一夜成为全国新星/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">49:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>肯尼迪意外输掉副总统候选提名，反而一夜成为全国新星</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1956年民主党史无前例地把副总统提名交给大会代表现场票选，肯尼迪虽在最后一轮惜败，却因此第一次成为全国瞩目的政治新星，还躲开了那年大选惨败的责任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治史</span><span class=\"tag\">肯尼迪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E257｜对话Vitalik：AI安全背后的哲学思想，有效利他主义如何影响硅谷？ EA (Effective Altruism) e/acc d/acc Neglectedness P(doom) Orthogonality thesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-28-sv101-vitalik锐评anthropic-安全话术与自身权力相关性超九成/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa770e4b48e5ff1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>Vitalik锐评Anthropic：安全话术与自身权力相关性超九成</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vitalik捐出数亿美元资助AI安全，如今却说各家AI实验室嘴上谈安全，但他们实际做的事和扩张自身权力的相关性可能超过九成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">有效利他主义</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Can You Use AI To Make Good Art? — With Fred Graver Compound Engineering / Compound Writing thousand true fans because/therefore framework (Ken Adams) Flow\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-28-aiandi-ai能帮你写剧本-拍节目-却解决不了独立编剧找观众这件事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1445d3aa23a8588-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">50:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>AI能帮你写剧本、拍节目，却解决不了独立编剧找观众这件事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这位艾美奖编剧把创作拆成构思、制作、触达观众三步，AI在前两步已经很好用，但怎样让一千个观众愿意为你每月付钱，目前还没人搭好这套基础设施。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI写作</span><span class=\"tag\">好莱坞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New Full-Stack Designer DialKit scroll jacking showstopper component Sidekick\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-28-ycsp-ai能写出任何代码-却分不清什么好看什么难看/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e7a683c298b3b270-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>AI能写出任何代码，却分不清什么好看什么难看</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Shopify设计工作室负责人说，AI已经能执行任意技术复杂度，但审美判断权仍在人手里——他调一个轮播动画用了91次提示，靠不断挑剔而不是动手画图，把关最终效果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI协作</span><span class=\"tag\">产品设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"He Learned to Code on Paper. Now He&#x27;s Fixing the Internet. | Chai Choudhary, Workers Formal verification Deterministic Simulation Testing (DST) ICP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-28-solofounders-ai生成的代码没人读得懂-验证正从奢侈品变成刚需/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dde5d2398d6bbf62-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>AI生成的代码没人读得懂，验证正从奢侈品变成刚需</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">过去做系统级验证成本太高没人愿意做，现在同样的算力花销能换来和最严苛测试一样的可靠性，不做反而说不过去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">软件验证</span><span class=\"tag\">形式化验证</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Agents Love Supabase AEO Vitess Multigress declarative schema MVCC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-28-latentspace-企业数据库几乎不会迁移-新客户才是真正能赢的战场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/303ec709f9a48d84-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>企业数据库几乎不会迁移：新客户才是真正能赢的战场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Supabase 内部数据显示企业几乎不会把生产数据库搬家，这决定了他们的增长策略是抢占绿地新项目，而不是攻克巨头的存量客户。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据库基建</span><span class=\"tag\">企业销售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Freedom of Action: America&#x27;s ASI Strategy, w/ RAND&#x27;s Joel Predd, Ben Boudreaux &amp; Matt Chessen freedom of action strategy wonder weapon pivot factor MAIM (Mutual Assured AI Malfunction)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-28-cogrev-智库说美国现在押注任何一种ai超级智能战略都太早/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5141cc7bc908a3d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:50:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>智库说美国现在押注任何一种AI超级智能战略都太早</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">七种AI战略各有清晰的赢法和阴暗结局，但没人能靠证据分出哪个对，于是RAND的建议是现在把各战略都用得上的基础能力先攒出来，而不是提前站队。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI国家战略</span><span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Bealings Bells poltergeist Mysore Wars Domesday Book\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-28-stuffmissed-被详细记录两个月的-闹铃-怪谈-可能只是一场讽刺/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">34:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>被详细记录两个月的「闹铃」怪谈，可能只是一场讽刺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一位退休军官详细记录自家门铃无故狂响两月，却在「确信非人力」与「可能是骗局」间反复摇摆——后世研究者认为，这种自相矛盾暴露了此书其实是对轻信灵异者的温和讽刺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">灵异传说</span><span class=\"tag\">历史悬案</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Artificial Analysis v5 and the benchmarker&#x27;s dilemma benchmax private benchmarks Intelligence Index\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-28-interconnects-新榜单让8个闭源模型都赢了最强开源模型-但这更像一次选择/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06b8dc9e016a16ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">10:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>新榜单让8个闭源模型都赢了最强开源模型，但这更像一次选择</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AAv5把评测权重押向模型正奔赴的前沿任务而非当下经济真正倚重的工作流，这个选择本身就决定了谁看起来更领先。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">基准测试</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Mark Cuban on Why AI Could Turn Solo Founders Into Trillionaires ASO (Administrative Services Only) PBM (Pharmacy Benefit Manager) BUCA ANDA (Abbreviated New Drug Application) N of one stop loss\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-28-a16z-ai对医保最大的用处不是看病-而是揪出合同里的坑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>AI对医保最大的用处不是看病，而是揪出合同里的坑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">医疗巨头靠数千家子公司把涨价的钱转给自己人，合同一旦签字AI也救不了你——唯一办法是签约前就把合同丢给AI问一句：哪里在坑我。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗保健</span><span class=\"tag\">健康险</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What&#x27;s Broken About China&#x27;s Economy + The Cost of Keeping China Out | Meg Rithmire mafia firms gray rhino mutual endangerment jiexiaoren anti-involution campaign reverse Tesla\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-27-chinatalk-别一刀切禁掉中国电动车-方案是复制当年引进特斯拉的打法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd95dc55d0b863a5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>别一刀切禁掉中国电动车：方案是复制当年引进特斯拉的打法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国当年靠强制本地化供应链和软硬件分离，把特斯拉变成了本土产业的老师；美国对中国电动车也该这样做，而不是一禁了之。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中国政治经济</span><span class=\"tag\">腐败与治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Anthropic ships the #1 LLM in the World safely: Separating the Brain from the Hands distillation trust grant Claude Managed Agent chain-of-thought extraction brain/hands architecture\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-27-latentspace-agent安全不是靠堵沙箱漏洞-而是把大脑和手分开放/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>Agent安全不是靠堵沙箱漏洞，而是把大脑和手分开放</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic把执行代理架构拆成常驻服务器上的「大脑」和随时可销毁的沙箱「手」，凭证只存在出口网关，agent从未真正碰到过它们，这是意外但最关键的安全收益。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Silicon Valley can’t slow down AI on its own | Luisa Rodriguez chain of thought AI safety levels checkpoint system superintelligence\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-27-eightythousand-ai公司都想减速-却没人敢先停-对手的ai研究员不休息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/28955397e0f13613-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">21:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>AI公司都想减速，却没人敢先停——对手的AI研究员不休息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">每一家AI公司都想减速，但没人敢先停：对手一旦用AI研究员取代人类，暂停一个月换来的可能是被反超几个月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI监管</span><span class=\"tag\">算力治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The airline CEO putting Starlink on every plane catchment-area flying CASM-X blended wing body Value at Risk (VaR)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-27-cheekypint-免费从来不是卖点-联合航空靠starlink的速度甩开对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/793e215f9d508567-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cheeky Pint</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>免费从来不是卖点，联合航空靠Starlink的速度甩开对手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">联合航空重建技术栈后，把Starlink当作两三年的竞争窗口全力冲刺，目标是趁机会抢下顾客的长期品牌忠诚度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航空业</span><span class=\"tag\">Starlink</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reinventing School for the AI Era | Joe Liemandt, Gagan Biyani &amp; Erik Torenberg learning engine magnet marketing brain lift World School\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-27-a16z-把学校压缩到两小时-50-的学生宁愿上学也不度假/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>把学校压缩到两小时：50%的学生宁愿上学也不度假</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创始人用认知科学加LLM把传统课程学习效率提到两小时，腾出的时间全部用来教团队协作、创业和人际关系——这些学校过去从不教的技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">K-12教育</span><span class=\"tag\">另类教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Cliff Sosin - Owning the Complements to Intelligence - [Invest Like the Best, EP.497] Jevons Paradox complements to intelligence diamond-shaped demand frontier vibe coding freestyle chess\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-27-ilt-智能终将免费-最值钱的是数据和注意力-不是模型本身/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6e8b9b39215b98db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>智能终将免费：最值钱的是数据和注意力，不是模型本身</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的核心判断是：智能会变得近乎免费，所以不该押注造算力和模型的公司，而该押注智能替代不了的数据、注意力和物理场景。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投资框架</span><span class=\"tag\">智能的互补品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Special Episode: Dr. Lindsey Fitzharris &amp; The Sleuth-Hound optography Penny Bloods expert witness thief takers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-27-tpwky-福尔摩斯作者恨透了这个角色-原型却是真实苏格兰医生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>福尔摩斯作者恨透了这个角色，原型却是真实苏格兰医生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">柯南道尔曾想杀掉福尔摩斯以摆脱这个角色，但正是爱丁堡解剖教室里那位教他「读病人」的外科医生贝尔，给了这个侦探全部的血肉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">福尔摩斯</span><span class=\"tag\">法医学史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"295: Situated: How Your Choices Today Shape Your Child&#x27;s Tomorrow | Angela Duckworth Three-box model fundamental attribution error food desert situational responsibility\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-27-asklisa-改变行为靠的不是意志力-而是换个处境/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d7c3fcaede22fdb0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">42:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>改变行为靠的不是意志力，而是换个处境</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理学家 Angela Duckworth 用自己差点离婚的婚姻和一套三步模型说明：比起死磕意志力或硬扭想法，改变所处的环境往往更省力也更有效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年养育</span><span class=\"tag\">行为改变</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Montague Summers Anglo-Catholicism Uranian verse Order of Chaeronea Malleus Maleficarum\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-26-stuffmissed-写遍女巫与吸血鬼的-神父-终身未必真正受过圣职/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>写遍女巫与吸血鬼的「神父」，终身未必真正受过圣职</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蒙塔古·萨默斯用一己之力把猎巫手册、吸血鬼传说搬进英语学术界，却终身没能找到任何确凿证据证明他真的被天主教会授予圣职。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">猎巫史</span><span class=\"tag\">吸血鬼传说</span>\n</div></div></a>"]